---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="404 — Bu Kutuyu Bulamadık | Kutuda Makarna"
  description="Aradığınız sayfa veya kutu bulunamadı. Sıcak ve taze makarnalarımızı keşfetmek için menümüze göz atın."
  canonical="https://kutudamakarna.com/404"
  activePath="/404"
>
  <div class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 bg-[#FBF9F5] text-center">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto space-y-6">
      
      <!-- 404 Empty Open Box Graphic -->
      <div class="relative w-36 h-36 mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-amber-400/80 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 shadow-md shadow-amber-950/5">
        <span class="text-5xl">📦</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#D97706] mt-2 tracking-wider">HATA 404</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#1C1917] tracking-tight font-sans">
        BU KUTUYU <span class="text-[#D97706]">BULAMADIK!</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Aradığın sayfa ya da lezzet kutusu henüz hazırlanmamış veya başka bir şubeye taşınmış olabilir.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/menu"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFB800] text-[#1C1917] font-black text-sm hover:bg-[#F59E0B] shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transition-transform hover:scale-105"
        >
          MENÜDEN KUTUNU SEÇ →
        </a>

        <a
          href="/"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-300 hover:border-stone-400 text-stone-800 font-bold text-sm transition-colors shadow-xs"
        >
          Ana Sayfaya Dön
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
